{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16106310","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16106310","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1610631001:1":{"text":"ニールさん、昨日、絵画の修復を行う際、あなたは何を担当しましたか？","source_cn":"尼尔，昨天在修复画像的考试时，你负责什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03E3E9F9FF036DC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1610631002:1":{"text":"俺は、ピッパーと一緒に絵に魔力を注入する係を任されました。校長先生が死んだこととは関係ありません！信じてください！","source_cn":"我和皮帕要一起给画像注入魔力，校长的死和我没关系！真的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D2C2666EE318858","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1610631003:1":{"text":"落ち着いてください。あなたは私の質問に答えるだけで大丈夫ですよ。魔力を注入するのに何の魔法を使ったのですか？なぜ、それで魔力を失うことに？","source_cn":"不要紧张，如实回答我的问题就好。你当时用了什么魔法，为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x734D7C6BC7C99B92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1610631004:1":{"text":"お、俺……","source_cn":"我……<key:dialog29>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77E10D7D8BEF0875","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1610631005:1":{"text":"ニールさん、試験で不正を働いたとしても、「殺害」の罪と比べれば遥かに軽いものです。あなたのためにも、正直に答えてください。","source_cn":"尼尔，即使你在考试中使用了违规手段，也不会比“谋杀”的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0110CF8B6CDFB96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1610631006:1":{"text":"お、俺……試験の前に<style=\"highlight\">特殊な魔力契約</style>を交わしたんです。そうすれば……魔力が強化されるから。","source_cn":"我……我在考试前签订了一个<style=highlig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x025C1F9FBFC7346C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1610631007:1":{"text":"魔力契約？それは、具体的にどのような契約ですか？","source_cn":"魔法契约？具体内容是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC47830E81941CF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1610631008:1":{"text":"契約すると、<style=\"highlight\">魔力が徐々に増えていく</style>んです。それから、一時的に大量の魔力が必要になった時は、契約から魔力を<style=\"highlight\">借りる</style>こともできます……","source_cn":"……就是能够让我的<style=highlight>魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FF4FBDD926506D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1610631009:1":{"text":"本当です。契約したあと、何もしなくても、本当に魔力が少しずつ増えていったんです！","source_cn":"契约签过以后，我的魔力真的在慢慢增长。非常神奇，我什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3141B9559CF9054","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1610631010:1":{"text":"それは、かなり妙な話ですね……契約から借りた魔力は、返却しなくてもいいのですか？","source_cn":"奇怪，这很不正常……你从契约中借用的魔力是否需要偿还？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D0EBAB1D6AC8082","variant_sta